OL,4,CZelensky says Putin is a 'killer'      
OL,5,Cafter Trump calls Russian leader a     
OL,6,Cfriend                                 
OL,7,GUkraine's President Volodymyr Zelensky 
OL,8,Ghas said Vladimir Putin is a "killer"  
OL,9,Gin response to Donald Trump referring  
OL,10,Gto the Russian leader as his "friend"  
OL,11,Gin China this week.                    
OL,13,FSpeaking to CNN, Zelensky said it was  
OL,14,Fup to the US president "how to call    
OL,15,FPutin" but "for us, he is an enemy...  
OL,16,Ffor us, he's a killer".                
